    "text": "For the non-stoichiometry&nbsp;reaction,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>A</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>B</mtext> <mo>&#8594;</mo> <mtext>C</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>D</mtext> </mrow> </math>, the following kinetic data were obtained in three separate experiments, all at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>.<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<thead>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">Initial Concentration (A)</th>\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">Initial Concentration (B)</th>\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">Initial rate of formation of C <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>mol L</mtext> <mo>-</mo> </msup> <msup> <mo>S</mo> <mo>-</mo> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math> &nbsp;</th>\t\t</tr>\t</thead>\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math> <mrow> <mtext>0.1 M</mtext> </mrow> </math></td>\t\t\t<td><math> <mrow> <mtext>0.1 M</mtext> </mrow> </math></td>\t\t\t<td><math> <mrow> <mtext>1.2</mtext> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mn>1</mn> <msup> <mn>0</mn> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math> <mrow> <mtext>0.1 M</mtext> </mrow> </math></td>\t\t\t<td><math> <mrow> <mtext>0.2 M</mtext> </mrow> </math></td>\t\t\t<td><math> <mrow> <mtext>1.2</mtext> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mn>1</mn> <msup> <mn>0</mn> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math> <mrow> <mtext>0.2 M</mtext> </mrow> </math></td>\t\t\t<td><math> <mrow> <mtext>0.1 M</mtext> </mrow> </math></td>\t\t\t<td><math> <mrow> <mtext>2.4</mtext> <mo>&#215;</mo> <mn>1</mn> <msup> <mn>0</mn> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><br />The rate law for the formation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> is&nbsp;",
