    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math> be the orders of the reaction with respect to the reactants <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Rate</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><msub><mi>Rate</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>II</mi></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><msub><mi>Rate</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>III</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mtext>II</mtext><mtext>I</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mtext>y</mtext></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>&#160;&#160;&#8756;&#160;&#160;</mo><mtext>y</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>III</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>I</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>&#8658;</mo> <msup> <mn>2</mn> <mn>1</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mtext>x</mtext> </msup> <mo>&#160;&#160;&#8756;&#160;&#160;</mo> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>Rate</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>k</mtext> <mo>&#183;</mo> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>A</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>1</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math></p>",
